"""Japanese AV / colloquial polish around Opus MT (prep + overrides + post).

Keeps soft-scene / NSFW wording (erotic senses). Opus-mt-ja-zh routinely
mangles genital slang, climax verbs, and oral terms (おまんこ→欢迎光临,
ちんぽ→贱人, イく→宜家, フェラ→费拉, しゃぶって→蹲下). Fix via:

  1) whole-cue overrides for short dialogue
  2) longest-first CJK pre-replace before Marian
  3) postprocess for residual failure modes
"""

from __future__ import annotations

